@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. API hoạt động -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sách bài tập -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tạo lượt nộp -> 201 và Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "DTC245200314",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/edusubmit.git"
}

### 4. MSSV rỗng -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/edusubmit.git"
}

### 5. Đọc lượt nộp vừa tạo -> 200 (chạy request 3 trước)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. GUID không tồn tại -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 7. AssignmentId không dương -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":0,"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/repo.git"}

### 8. Thiếu repositoryUrl -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":1,"studentCode":"SV001"}
